window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>He’s grumpy. He’s charming. He wants me to stay with him in the woods.</p> <p>And the craziest part?</p> <p>I think I just might do it.</p> <p>Colt Walker is a charming grump.</p> <p>Okay fine. He’s a hot, charming grump.</p> <p>I’ll give him that.</p> <p>Even though me being stuck out here alone is my own fault.</p> <p>He doesn’t make me feel bad about it.</p> <p>Or ask me my why I’m trying to avoid my stepsister’s wedding.</p> <p>He just scoops me into his arms and carries me off into the woods.</p> <p>Back to his cabin. Where he lives.</p> <p>I’m not normally like this.</p> <p>I swear.</p> <p>But there’s something kind of nice about being cared for.</p> <p>Being protected.</p> <p>And now that he wants me to stay the night</p> <p>I’m not sure if I’ll ever want to leave…</p>"; 
